<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of European Cup matches</p>
<p>played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p>In Edinburgh: Edinburgh (Scotland) 23 Treviso (Italy) 43</p>
<p>(halftime 11-26)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Edinburgh - Tries: Alistair Donaldson, Derek Lee, Andrew</p>
<p>Lucking. Conversions: Duncan Hodge. Penalties: Hodge 2</p>
<p>Treviso - Tries: Leonardo Perziano 2, Alessandro Troncon 2,</p>
<p>Giovanni Grespan, Francesco Mazzariol, Andrea Scorlon.</p>
<p>Conversions: Mazzariol 4</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,500</p>
<p>Pool C</p>
<p>In Brive: Brive (France) 23 Harlequins (England) 10 (12-10)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brive - Try: Sebastien Carrat, Penalties: Christophe</p>
<p>Lamaison 4, Drop goal: Alain Penaud, Philippe Carbonneau</p>
<p>Harlequins - Try: Paul Challinor, Penalty: Will Carling,</p>
<p>Conversion: Carling</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p>Pool D</p>
<p>In Cardiff: Cardiff (Wales) 41 Milan (Italy) 19 (23-13)</p>
<p>Cardiff - Tries: Mark Bennett, Mike Hall, Robert Howley,</p>
<p>Justin Thomas. Conversions: Lee Jarvis 3. Penalties: Jarvis 5</p>
<p>Milan - Tries: Alberto Marengoni. Conversions: Diego</p>
<p>Dominguez. Penalties: Dominguez 4</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
